{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/大巴扎的晴空","pageid":6383,"revid":15522,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%89%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%99%B4%E7%A9%BA&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%89%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%99%B4%E7%A9%BA&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%89%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%99%B4%E7%A9%BA&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>大巴扎的晴空</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.A4.A7.E5.B7.B4.E6.89.8E.E7.9A.84.E6.99.B4.E7.A9.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"大巴扎的晴空\"><b>大巴扎的晴空</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 大巴扎的晴空.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a0/bvxm5sor2i9fricbs1xm0apmiz4l51j.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%89%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%99%B4%E7%A9%BA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a0/bvxm5sor2i9fricbs1xm0apmiz4l51j.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%89%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%99%B4%E7%A9%BA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a0/bvxm5sor2i9fricbs1xm0apmiz4l51j.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />大巴扎的晴空\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，个性中的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">巴卢尔</span>]造成伤害倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">16%</font>。<br />✦治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">15%</font>；对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">巴卢尔</span>]停留的目标额外提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">10%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">哈沙拉姆狂欢节</span>]拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放枷锁</font></span></span>]标签。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，个性中的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">巴卢尔</span>]造成伤害倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">16%</font>，攻击后[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">霍玛</span>]获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。<br />✦治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">15%</font>；对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">巴卢尔</span>]停留的目标额外提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">15%</font>。<br />✦拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，释放技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">哈沙拉姆狂欢节</font></span>]时，对范围内敌人攻击后额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"致盲\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">致盲</font></span></span>]（持续1回合），且该技能冷却回合减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>，之后消耗10层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。个技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">哈沙拉姆狂欢节</span>]拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放枷锁</font></span></span>]标签。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，个性中的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">巴卢尔</span>]造成伤害倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，攻击后[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">霍玛</span>]获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。<br />✦治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>；对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">巴卢尔</span>]停留的目标额外提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>。<br />✦拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，释放技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">哈沙拉姆狂欢节</font></span>]时，对范围内敌人攻击后额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼物防3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼物防3</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"致盲\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">致盲</font></span></span>]（持续1回合），且该技能冷却回合减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>，之后消耗10层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">哈沙拉姆狂欢节</span>]拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放枷锁</font></span></span>]标签。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"决意之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/40px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/60px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/80px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"决意之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/40px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/60px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/80px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"谋定之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/40px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset